"5_store-friends.png", "id": "2329923427765315", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491830904_2329923431098648_2586394273617079249_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Oc57yIco7t8Q7kNvwERSQ3j&_nc_oc=AdpXgQ13B1WxIUB0dRzq7SBaHEBgEGLVmzpR7sRY5uQGHPeNqsdagOjevtE8kmk_v9Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQVk0Z_oUtA0gOuO3jjckhnhmNmYGg_5aKjyeGC3LDMHeg&oe=6B0EFA75"}, {"file_name": "3_yeti-king.png", "id": "29266483926352893", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/908835860_29266483933019559_4350275521366186301_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=5FgW1eTfUh4Q7kNvwG3AXzt&_nc_oc=AdpbVd1MpMcBPdEeRu5UVxAzHNhizXWAFnZdL_ea-lmxJrnfg8RdMrWJaatBG7US7F0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQUQrGBXRtQiBi_TuN7ZMab_V4zaxunAoOr0WXgKxxWDsg&oe=6B0F024C"}, {"file_name": "4_hot-rod-tunnel.png", "id": "1633019818132916", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/908835865_1633019821466249_7253041770808807894_n.png?_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=x1ABgrOVRV8Q7kNvwHFgxWJ&_nc_oc=Adr6twtxX9Nopsv3TCqh6yYPKl16u8egoQ4L85O8xnnQ81hC7A9mhWvSY5w-WuJd6N8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQXf-GKdhuwGKHjw8458LO9H54jOPKco-AHk59uNnpwkkg&oe=6B0EF478"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "cover.png", "id": "1539587454862288", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/595114885_1539587458195621_1583328559053055241_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zN7JWl6k3CYQ7kNvwGmhlP4&_nc_oc=AdpCZh7C2w7F1IISFlrz5R8M4-u9TgFR85qeJvYt5mkFadfp5-lj9KGLYNcAm469QyI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQXnoo6Z8cWI_dMC5OxIBXD3Q0bm3asWjUFyN_EfcqJtNA&oe=6B0EECBF"}, "display_name": "Fable Brawlers", "keywords": ["brawler", "coop", "fantasy", "multiplayer"], "long_description": "Once upon a time, the monsters got out of the storybooks. Time to punch them back in! \ud83d\udcd6\n\nTeam up with up to 10 friends online or play solo, in a world redrawn in bold, hand-inked comic-book style.\n\n\ud83e\udd4a REAL FIGHTING\nThe faster you swing, the harder you hit. Guard, land combos and stagger the big ones. Wear boxing gloves or fight bare-handed, every finger following your grip.\n\n\ud83c\udfad WEAR THE LEGENDS\nBosses drop magic masks. Put one on and become that legend: throw monsters as Grimclaw or call down lightning as Stormcaller. Masks level up and come in six rarities.\n\n\ud83c\udf08 THE FABLE TRIAL\nBeat a giant snake, a fire dragon and the Shattered King to turn a Mystic mask into a Fable.\n\n\ud83d\udc3e PETS AND MOUNTS\nCatch puppies, kittens and baby dragons to fight beside you. Tame horses, unicorns and reindeer and ride them.\n\n\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f A WORLD TO EXPLORE\nGiant mountains, waterfalls and winding tunnels lead from the shielded village to the Wildwood, snowy Frostpeak and the Sunken Isles, home to over twenty bosses.\n\n\ud83c\udf85 CHRISTMAS EVENT\nSanta has been captured! Beat the Yeti King to free him and win a Santa Hat.\n\n\ud83c\udfe1 HANG OUT AT HOME\nPaint your house, climb your Treehouse, dress up and drive your hot rod or boat.\n\n\ud83d\udc8e FAIR AND FREE\nFree to play. Earn every mask by playing, or fast-track with a bundle. Nothing you buy is random.\n\n\ud83c\udfae COMFORT YOUR WAY\nStanding or roomscale. Arm or thumbstick movement, snap or smooth turning.", "short_description": "Punch your way through a comic-book fairy-tale world with up to 10 friends! \ud83e\udd4a Win magic masks from bosses and become legends like Grimclaw the werewolf and Stormcaller. Tame and ride horses, unicorns and reindeer \ud83e\udd84, explore giant mountains and winding tunnels, and free Santa from the Yeti King this Christmas. \ud83c\udf85 Make a house of your own and fight with gloves or bare hands. Free to play, and nothing you buy is random. \u2728"}]}, "developer_name": "CD", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://fablebrawlersvr.com/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "CD", "support_website_url": "https://fablebrawlersvr.com/feedback", "website_url": "https://fablebrawlersvr.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_FEW", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2691890164460465"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER", "SINGLE_USER", "CO_OP"], "id": "1430502216819274"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/908835825_1764165098147248_3639362251126165539_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=rMYiLkChVXAQ7kNvwEBPySu&_nc_oc=Adr50-h2-ji0yL7qb8w2M88JHlHXitheQnCnSm42rfLAf-l4pNyw_sgX1yGqKqj1amc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQX1Mtq3BHvqdtkfEjP-cJo2eKhpJrzTqiVO5bymmACTGA&oe=6B0F2164"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "Fable Brawlers", "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "context_category": {"context_category": "GAMES", "id": "2743326035925534"}, "context_topics": [{"topic_name": "Adventure", "id": "2691890164460465"}], "release_date": 1793739360, "lastRevision": {"nodes": [{"id": "1349579094911587", "release_type": "SCHEDULED", "administration_status": "APPROVED", "pdp_metadata": {"application": {"default_locale": "en_US", "